{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"mindless-misogynic-nematode","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nGerrit 3359 (confident-snooty-stinkpot, merged aed975de61c) got LLM-Review +1 with 5 advisory findings, deliberately not re-pushed (a new patch set resets both votes):\n\n1. `plan_review_recovery._agentic_outcome` builds a fresh LLMOutcome with only `{exception_type}` for budget, tool-loop and truncation failures, dropping the run-shape `diagnostic` that `run_failure` already attaches to LLMBudgetExhaustedError and RunawayToolLoopError.\n2. The comment above the pipeline-only post-dispatch tail in `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py` (~:620) still lists \"interim\" agentic verdicts; the interim INDETERMINATE no longer exists.\n3. No test exercises the production `stop_reason` stamping in `structured.check_stop_reason`/`check_response`; the failure-class tests set it by hand.\n4. No test asserts that the DET advisories/coverage and the agent's `provider_provenance` reach the adapted verdict through `plan-review.yaml`.\n5. The truncation table covers `max_tokens` but not `length`.\n\n## Approach\n\n- Carry `getattr(exc, \"diagnostic\", {})` into the classified outcome (sanitized through `failure.sanitize_diagnostic`).\n- Fix the stale comment.\n- Add tests: `check_stop_reason(\"refusal\")` and a refusal in `provider_details` each set `stop_reason`; a DET-advisory plan's agentic verdict carries the DET finding and the fake runner's `provider_provenance`; the `length` case.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The 5 items above are addressed, pinned by tests in `tests/unit/test_plan_review_agentic_verdict.py` and `tests/unit/test_structured*.py`.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","id":"f04a-6819-c968-4826","parent_id":"9794-4336-5ed6-4561","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Agentic adapter follow-ups from change 3359 review"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1794461500904460016,"uuid":"4d501b4c-34ff-4386-8dd6-9a68116862db"}